  "body_html": "<p>Keep your most cherished memories close with a custom photo collage blanket, carefully crafted by Jeminise. This beautiful blanket is the perfect way to display your favorite family moments, featuring a custom photo layout and personalized text at the center. Whether you are celebrating a special occasion or creating a unique keepsake for your home, this soft and cozy blanket brings warmth, comfort, and love to any space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your blanket with high-resolution photo prints and add your own custom text at the center to create a one-of-a-kind keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Comfort:</strong> Crafted from a lightweight and breathable cotton blend fabric with high-quality silk floss fill, offering a comfortable heavyweight warmth description suitable for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Family Gift:</strong> An unforgettable gift for Mother's Day, birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, or Christmas to surprise your mom, grandmother, family members, or friends.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from a range of sizes to suit your needs, including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your custom bedding look with optional matching personalized pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This durable blanket is easy to clean, machine washable, and dries quickly for convenient everyday maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester &amp; Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>5 Photo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Bohemian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Mother's Day</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs &amp; up to 10 photos</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Spring, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
